        "Namak",
        "Cheeni",
        "Baking Soda / Meetha Soda",
        "Dahi",
        "Oil"
      ],
      "produces_component": "bhature dough",
      "station": "counter",
      "interruptible": false,
      "freshness": "none",
      "freshness_cue": null,
      "max_lead_min": null,
      "doneness_cue": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Dough par oil lagaye: dough par 1 chammach oil laga kar bowl mein dhak kar kam se kam 30 मिनट ke liye rest karein; creator ne kaha \"6 hours tak isko foolne dena hai\" as best result — \"6 घंटे तक इसे फूलने देना है\" (optional longer rest).",
      "label": "Rest dough",
      "attention": "unattended",
      "attention_cue": "6 घंटे तक इसको फूलने देना है",
      "duration_typical_min": 360.0,
      "duration_min": 30.0,
      "duration_max": 360.0,
