    {
      "text": "Masale daale: 2 tsp Chole / Chana Masala, 1/2 tsp Yellow Chilli Powder, 1/2 tsp Red Chilli Powder, 1 tsp Dhania Powder, 1/2 tsp Jeera Powder ko 2 मिनट tak bhune jab tak oil chamakne lage.",
      "label": "Add spices",
