    {
      "text": "Tel ko achhi tarah garam karein (high flame). Bhature ko garam tel mein daalte hi jab woh phoolne lage to palat dein (transcript: \"jab ye phool mein lagta hai na वैसे पलट देना है\"), phir dono taraf golden hone tak sek lein.",
